language + region + keyboard, internet + disk + method, review) and the final install screen.
This file only draws and navigates. Choices, checks and texts live in xlinos_install_core.py; disks in xlinos_disks.py;
the real work is done by the engine xlinos-install-run, which re-checks everything itself."""
